OL,3,GNEWSAAffordable homes secured after
OL,4,Acouncil purchase
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of affordable homes are being
OL,7,Fbought by a council after it revealed
OL,8,Fthere was a risk they would not be
OL,9,Fbuilt on a new development.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council said it
OL,12,Fhad secured 87 properties from Tila
OL,13,FHomes, in the Landimore Road
OL,14,Fdevelopment in Hardingstone,
OL,15,FNorthampton, as "there was a risk the
OL,16,Faffordable housing provision would not
OL,17,Fbe delivered as intended".
OL,19,FIt said 61 homes would be available for
OL,20,Fsocial rent and 26 for shared
OL,21,Fownership.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
