OL,3,GNEWSAAffordable homes secured after
OL,4,Acouncil purchase
OL,5,
OL,6,FTila, on its website, said that 750
OL,7,Ftwo, three, four and five-bedroom homes
OL,8,Fwere being built with prices starting
OL,9,Ffrom #344,995. It has been approached
OL,10,Ffor comment.
